	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『サクラ大戦２』より、ヒロインの一人である真宮寺さくらの機体がHGから登場！",
			"• 細部までこだわった造形で約125mmサイズの中に洗練された光武・改の魅力を凝縮。",
			"• 搭乗ハッチを開閉できるギミックを搭載。コックピットに付属のフィギュアを搭乗させることが可能。",
			"• アイカメラを左右に動かせるギミックにより、ポージングに合わせた自然な視線移動を表現。",
			"• 内部構造には版元監修のもと、プラモデルならではの新解釈を追加。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Sakura Wars 2\", the aircraft of one of the heroines, Sakura Shinguji, is now available from HG!",
			"• The sophisticated charm of Mitsubu Kai is condensed into a size of approximately 125mm with attention to detail.",
			"• Equipped with a gimmick that allows you to open and close the boarding hatch. It is possible to board the included figure in the cockpit.",
			"• A gimmick that allows the eye camera to move left and right allows for natural eye movements that match the pose.",
			"• Under the supervision of the publisher, new interpretations unique to plastic models have been added to the internal structure."
		]
	},
